WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:06.705
The seven Gildongs were brought to the king.

2
00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:12.703
"Which of you is the real Hong Gildong?" the king asked.

3
00:00:12.704 --> 00:00:15.571
"I am, Your Majesty," one said.

4
00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:19.491
"No, I am, Your Majesty," another said.

5
00:00:19.492 --> 00:00:24.144
"You're too ugly to be me," a third said to the second.

6
00:00:24.145 --> 00:00:26.996
The second Gildong turned red.

7
00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:30.181
"How dare you insult me in front of the king!"

8
00:00:30.182 --> 00:00:37.885
The seven Gildongs all shouted at each other.

9
00:00:37.886 --> 00:00:41.422
"Silence!" the king yelled.

10
00:00:41.423 --> 00:00:45.390
"Chief Heup, you've seen Gildong before.

11
00:00:45.391 --> 00:00:49.315
Which is the real one?"

12
00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:53.635
Heup inspected the Gildongs.

13
00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:56.305
"Nice to see you again!" one said.

14
00:00:56.306 --> 00:01:03.460
Another grinned. "Have I caused you too much trouble?"

15
00:01:03.461 --> 00:01:07.709
"They all look the same, Your Majesty," Heup said.

16
00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:13.720
The king frowned. "Certainly his father would know.

17
00:01:13.721 --> 00:01:20.191
Chief Heup, bring Lord Hong here!"

18
00:01:20.192 --> 00:01:25.020
The Gildongs grew quiet when Lord Hong appeared.

19
00:01:25.021 --> 00:01:28.924
He seemed to be in pain as he bowed to the king.

20
00:01:28.925 --> 00:01:31.674
"Your Majesty," he said.

21
00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:37.345
"Since my lowborn son left home, I have been sick with worry.

22
00:01:37.346 --> 00:01:40.846
Now I have little time left to live.

23
00:01:40.847 --> 00:01:43.823
But I am here to serve you."

24
00:01:43.824 --> 00:01:51.534
"Then prove your loyalty. Tell me which one is real!" the king shouted.

25
00:01:51.535 --> 00:01:57.240
Heup led Lord Hong to the Gildongs.

26
00:01:57.241 --> 00:02:03.474
But all seven were identical.

27
00:02:03.475 --> 00:02:07.262
Lord Hong shook with fear.

28
00:02:07.263 --> 00:02:13.498
"I'm sorry, Your Majesty. I cannot tell which is the real Gildong."

29
00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:18.691
"How can you not know your own child?" the king roared.

30
00:02:18.692 --> 00:02:23.193
"Your lowborn boy has done terrible crimes.

31
00:02:23.194 --> 00:02:28.563
When I find the real Gildong, I'll punish you both!"

32
00:02:28.564 --> 00:02:33.784
At this, Lord Hong collapsed.

33
00:02:33.785 --> 00:02:37.311
The Gildongs rushed over to Lord Hong.

34
00:02:37.312 --> 00:02:43.369
They each took medicine from their sleeves and gave it to him.

35
00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:48.714
Soon his eyes opened, and he looked at them with sadness.

36
00:02:48.715 --> 00:02:56.850
Palace guards took Lord Hong away.

37
00:02:56.851 --> 00:03:00.788
"I'm sorry," a Gildong called out.

38
00:03:00.789 --> 00:03:06.868
"Quiet, you!" Heup growled, kicking the Gildong.

39
00:03:06.869 --> 00:03:11.428
Poof! The Gildong turned into a straw figure.

40
00:03:11.429 --> 00:03:14.886
Everyone in the courtyard gasped.

41
00:03:14.887 --> 00:03:19.119
"Now there's six left," the king said.

42
00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:21.901
"Find the real one!"

43
00:03:21.902 --> 00:03:25.197
Heup kicked another Gildong hard.

44
00:03:25.198 --> 00:03:28.803
Poof! That one turned to straw too.

45
00:03:28.804 --> 00:03:32.829
He kicked the Gildongs one by one.

46
00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:36.254
Each one turned to straw.

47
00:03:36.255 --> 00:03:39.679
Finally Heup reached the last Gildong.

48
00:03:39.680 --> 00:03:42.415
He took out his sword and grinned.

49
00:03:42.416 --> 00:03:46.264
"Your crimes end now!"

50
00:03:46.265 --> 00:03:50.090
Gildong smiled as a strong wind blew.

51
00:03:50.091 --> 00:03:52.672
He shot into the air.

52
00:03:52.673 --> 00:03:54.712
Heup looked up.

53
00:03:54.713 --> 00:03:59.340
Gildong was floating on a cloud above the crowd.

54
00:03:59.341 --> 00:04:03.388
"Chief Heup, get him!" the king ordered.

55
00:04:03.389 --> 00:04:10.992
"Archers!" Heup cried.

56
00:04:10.993 --> 00:04:22.914
"Fire your arrows!"

